IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `dg-core`
IMPORT `dg8-s268-certificate-amendments-and-disclosure-schedules`

-- Tests of section 268 (amendments to the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation; disclosure schedules).
-- Every expected value was decided by reading the text of section 268 (src:1382-1385) and written here before running; none was copied from the code's output.

§ `s 268(a)`

-- Text: the subsection applies where an agreement of merger entered into under any provision of the subchapter other than section 251(g) provides that all the issued and outstanding shares of the constituent corporation
-- are to be converted into or exchanged for cash, property, rights or securities (excluding stock of the surviving corporation). Arguments: entered into under 251(g), all shares to be converted into such consideration.
#ASSERT `s 268(a) the subsection applies to the constituent corporation` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 268(a) the subsection applies to the constituent corporation` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 268(a) the subsection applies to the constituent corporation` FALSE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 268(a) the subsection applies to the constituent corporation` TRUE FALSE)

-- Text, (i): the agreement as approved by the board need not include any provision regarding the surviving corporation's certificate of incorporation.
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(i) the agreement approved by the board need not include any provision regarding the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(i) the agreement approved by the board need not include any provision regarding the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Text, (ii): the amendment may be adopted by the board of the constituent corporation or a person acting at its direction; or, if the shares or equity interests of a constituent entity are to be converted into all the
-- shares of capital stock of the surviving corporation, by the board or governing body of that entity or a person acting at its direction. Arguments: who, the subsection applies, the conversion into all the shares.
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `the board of directors of the constituent corporation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `a person acting at the direction of the board of directors of the constituent corporation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `the board of directors of the constituent corporation` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `the board of directors or governing body of a constituent entity whose shares or equity interests are to be converted into all of the shares of capital stock of the surviving corporation` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `a person acting at the direction of the board of directors or governing body of such a constituent entity` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `the board of directors or governing body of a constituent entity whose shares or equity interests are to be converted into all of the shares of capital stock of the surviving corporation` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `a person acting at the direction of the board of directors or governing body of such a constituent entity` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `the board of directors or governing body of a constituent entity whose shares or equity interests are to be converted into all of the shares of capital stock of the surviving corporation` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a person the subsection does not name: not covered by it
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(ii) the person may adopt an amendment of the certificate of incorporation of the surviving corporation` `any other person` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

-- Text, (iii): no alteration or change of the certificate of incorporation is deemed an amendment to the agreement of merger. Where the subsection does not apply, it says nothing.
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(iii) the alteration or change of the certificate of incorporation is deemed an amendment to the agreement of merger` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 268(a)(iii) the alteration or change of the certificate of incorporation is deemed an amendment to the agreement of merger` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `s 268(b)`

-- Text: disclosure schedules and similar documents "shall not be deemed part of the agreement for purposes of any provision of this title but shall have the effects provided in the agreement", unless the agreement expressly provides otherwise.
-- Arguments: the document is such a schedule or letter, the agreement expressly provides otherwise.
#ASSERT `s 268(b) the disclosure schedule is part of the agreement for purposes of any provision of the title` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 268(b) the disclosure schedule is part of the agreement for purposes of any provision of the title` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 268(b) the disclosure schedule is part of the agreement for purposes of any provision of the title` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 268(b) the disclosure schedule has the effects provided in the agreement` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`s 268(b) the disclosure schedule has the effects provided in the agreement` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT (`s 268(b) the disclosure schedule has the effects provided in the agreement` FALSE FALSE)
